# .cbmignore — what the codebase-memory-mcp indexer sees.
# Gitignore syntax; shapes indexing only, no effect on git itself.
# Docs: codebase-memory-mcp/docs/cbmignore.md

# nasa-archive is a scooter-rally photo archive: ~290M of JSON data dumps
# (resolved URLs + per-rally photo manifests), not code. The 50M
# resolved_urls.json sits under the 512 MiB default file cap, so the indexer
# WOULD parse it via the JSON grammar — a memory/time sink for zero code
# intelligence. Drop the payload; keep the app's Python/HTML/JS.
/apps/nasa-archive/data/
/apps/nasa-archive/downloader/

# Disposable app sandboxes and dev venvs (seeded DBs, fake clones — not source).
.sandbox/
.venv-dev/
